  "source": "## Semantics: T2, T1, C1, M0, A1\ngrammar ConformanceCasefoldUnicode version \"1.0.0\" mode \"v1\" {\n  ## Case-insensitive literal with a non-ASCII letter.\n  main = %i\"é\" %x21\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"é!\"\n    accept \"É!\"\n    reject \"e!\"\n  }\n}\n",
